<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end lower on dealers' sales.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end lower on dealers' sales.</headline>
<text>
<p>*JGB futures end down on dealers' position-adjustment sales. *Cash JGBs also weak but some public fund bodies were seen buying benchmark 182nd JGBs, traders said.</p>
<p>*Massive supply of new corporate bonds made JGBs' upside heavy, traders said.</p>
</text>
